heretic-void-ritual-invalid-location = ritual failed, invalid location!

heretic-void-ritual-too-warm = ritual failed, not cold enough!

heretic-void-conduit-too-warm = { $sword } hums with power, but { $target } is not cold enough to create a conduit!

heretic-void-conduit-plunge-self = You plunge { $sword } deep into { $turf }, trying to rip open a conduit to the void!

heretic-void-conduit-plunge-space = { $source } plunges { $their } { $sword } into { $turf } - but instead of nothing happening, a dark energy begins to flow from the site!

heretic-void-conduit-plunge-other = { $source } plunges { $their } { $sword } into { $turf } - contrary to what you expected, a dark energy begins to flow from the site!

heretic-void-conduit-open-self = The conduit opens, releasing a storm of void energy! { $sword } shatters into a million tiny shards!

heretic-void-conduit-open-others = A conduit to the void opens, releasing a storm of void energy!

heretic-void-final-deflect-others = The void storm surrounding { $heretic } deflects { $projectile }!

heretic-void-final-deflect-self = The void storm protects you from { $projectile }!
